message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
authors:
  - family-names: Das
    given-names: Bidit
title: "Does Symbolic Grounding Inoculate LLM Agents Against Conformity?"
abstract: >
  A pre-registered experiment on harmful conformity in multi-agent debate,
  testing whether the debated medium (prose vs. an executable program) changes
  how often a correct agent defers to a confident wrong peer. Reports a null
  primary contrast and a benchmark-saturation obstacle that bounds it.
year: 2026
license: MIT
